---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How AIStackHub handles cookies, ads, and visitor data."
>
  <div class="wrap section-head prose" style="padding-bottom: 3rem;">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: September 2026</em></p>

    <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      This website (AIStackHub) is operated by Zaiedd. The site is hosted on
      Cloudflare Pages and serves static content — no accounts, no purchases, and
      no personal data you hand us directly, unless you email us.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Data we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Information you send us.</strong> If you contact us by email, we only use your message and address to reply. We don't sell or share it.</li>
      <li><strong>Cookies and usage data.</strong> When advertising from Google AdSense is enabled, Google and its partners may set cookies to serve and measure ads, including personalized ads based on your browsing across sites.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> If we add an analytics tool in the future, it collects only aggregated, anonymized visit statistics (pages viewed, rough location, device type) — not your name or personal identity.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. Cookies and advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
    <p>
      Google uses cookies (including the DART cookie) to serve ads based on your
      prior visits to this and other websites. Google's
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ad
      technology</a> also uses the DoubleClick cookie to serve personalized ads.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>You can opt out of personalized ads in
        <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>You can learn more and opt out of many third-party ad networks through the
        <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Network Advertising
        Initiative opt-out page</a> (US) and the <a href="https://www.youronlinechoices.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener">European
        Interactive Digital Advertising Alliance</a> (EU).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. How you can opt out of cookies</h2>
    <p>
      You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings, and most
      browsers let you add a "do not track" preference. Blocking cookies won't
      stop the site from working — it may just mean ads are less tailored to you.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Where we store data</h2>
    <p>
      All site files are static HTML served from Cloudflare's edge network. Any
      email you send is stored in our own inbox and is not published anywhere.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      This site doesn't target children under 13 and we don't knowingly collect
      their data. Content is aimed at secondary-school and university students and
      adults.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request a copy of, correction of, or deletion of any personal data
      we hold about you by writing to the email on the Contact page. We'll act on
      reasonable requests within 30 days.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we add new features that change how data is handled, we'll update this
      page. We'll note any changes by updating the "Last updated" date at the top.
      We encourage you to check this page occasionally.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Email us at
      <a href="mailto:mahmoudsaied7722@gmail.com">mahmoudsaied7722@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>